docs {
  # Gets the external ID token for setting an IAM role

  You'll need it for the role-based AWS authentication.

  **Auth:** Api-Token only (OAuth not supported by this endpoint). Uses `{{DT_API_TOKEN}}`.

  **API token scopes:** ReadConfig
}
